# Optional M5Stamp Fly GPS-less OpticalFlow/Baro profile; load on the aircraft, not Atom JoyStick.
# Navigation source configuration only; hardware drivers and calibration are separate.
# Prerequisites: healthy EKF3/barometer; enabled and healthy OpticalFlow/downward RangeFinder.
# Do not test AltHold/Loiter without a healthy barometer; HEAD board support is not guaranteed.
# Keep the vehicle stationary during EKF initialization; verify source health before Loiter.
# Use sufficient lighting and textured ground within the configured RangeFinder's valid range.
# RangeFinder supplies terrain/ground distance for Flow velocity scaling, not primary POSZ.
# Baro remains primary height; RangeFinder height switching and Surface Tracking are not enabled here.
# Use source set 1; verify switching does not select another saved source set (2/3) during testing.
# GPS hardware/checks are unchanged; this source set does not automatically switch to GPS navigation.
# Yaw has no external absolute observation; gyro-based yaw can drift.
# Relative Flow navigation may work without global origin, but EKF failsafe behavior depends on it.
# Before flight testing, verify/set EKF origin as appropriate and test failsafe with and without origin.
# Flow loss can remove horizontal aiding; automatic fallback to AltHold is not guaranteed.
# RangeFinder NoData/OutOfRange can make Flow navigation unusable through loss of ground-distance scaling.
# This profile provides no automatic sensor recovery and changes no arming/failsafe or RC/mode settings.
# Before applying, save/download current parameters. Load this optional profile and reboot.
# After reboot, verify parameter values, source set 1 and EKF/sensor health.
# To revert, restore the parameter backup or changed parameters explicitly; deleting this file does not reset them.
# Loading this profile does not prove that AltHold or Loiter is safe or ready for flight.
AHRS_EKF_TYPE 3
EK3_ENABLE 1

EK3_SRC1_POSXY 0
EK3_SRC1_VELXY 5
EK3_SRC1_POSZ 1
EK3_SRC1_VELZ 0
EK3_SRC1_YAW 0

EK3_SRC_OPTIONS 0
EK3_FLOW_USE 1
EK3_RNG_USE_HGT -1
